/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the context of enterprise-ready AI, the end goal of RAG and fine-tuning are the same: drive greater business value from AI models. But rather than augmenting an existing LLM with access to a proprietary database, fine-tuning goes deeper by tailoring the model itself for a specific domain. )
