>>
endobj
245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Fine-tuning a large AI model is resource-intensive, requiring significant time and compute power. By leveraging first-party data into responses instead of model parameters, RAG is able to limit resource cost at both the compute level be eliminating the training stage as well as the human level by avoiding the weeks- or months-long process of crafting and labeling training sets.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
